---
/**
 * The AtLeast app icon with concentric ripple rings, used as a visual divider
 * between the hero and the rest of the home page. Rings are decorative and
 * animate only when the visitor has not asked for reduced motion (see
 * `.ring-ripple` in `src/styles/global.css`).
 */
---

<div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
  <span
    class="ring-ripple absolute h-40 w-40 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-accent/40 md:h-56 md:w-56"
    style="animation-delay: 0s"
    aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span
    class="ring-ripple absolute h-40 w-40 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-pulse/40 md:h-56 md:w-56"
    style="animation-delay: 1.5s"
    aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <span
    class="ring-ripple absolute h-40 w-40 rounded-full border-2 border-brand-accent/40 md:h-56 md:w-56"
    style="animation-delay: 3s"
    aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <picture class="relative">
    <source srcset="/press/icons/watchos/icon-512.webp" type="image/webp" />
    <img
      src="/press/icons/watchos/icon-512.png"
      alt="AtLeast app icon"
      width="256"
      height="256"
      class="h-40 w-40 rounded-full md:h-56 md:w-56"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </picture>
</div>
